OL,3,APM urges social media companies to     
OL,4,A'show some decency' and take down Brand
OL,5,Avideo                                  
OL,7,FSocial media companies should "show    
OL,8,Fsome decency and take these videos     
OL,9,Fdown", the prime minister has said,    
OL,10,Ffollowing a government attempt to have 
OL,11,Fa YouTube video featuring a message    
OL,12,Ffrom the jailed comedian removed.      
OL,14,FThe site's owner Google refused a      
OL,15,Fgovernment request to remove the clip  
OL,16,Fposted by Brand's wife in which he     
OL,17,Fclaims his innocence, Whitehall sources
OL,18,Fhave told the BBC.                     
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
