OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APM urges social media companies to     
OL,4,A'show some decency' and take down Brand
OL,5,Avideo                                  
OL,7,FBrand was sentenced to 10-and-a-half   
OL,8,Fyears in prison after being convicted  
OL,9,Fof rape and three counts of sexual     
OL,10,Fassault.                               
OL,12,FSpeaking following a Coalition of the  
OL,13,FWilling meeting in Berlin, Andy Burnham
OL,14,Fsaid it was "time that we focus on the 
OL,15,Fvictims and think about them," rather  
OL,16,Fthan "hearing from a convicted         
OL,17,Fcriminal".                             
